### University Facility Booking API - test requests
### How to use: install the VS Code extension "REST Client", then click
### "Send Request" above each block, from top to bottom.
### Every sample account uses the password: Password@123
###
### IMPORTANT: change @day below to a date 2 to 30 days from today.
### Times are 30-minute slots: 07:01-07:30, 07:31-08:00, ... , 20:31-21:00.

@api = http://localhost:3000/api
@day = 2026-09-25

### Is the server running?
GET {{api}}/health

### ======================= REGISTER / LOGIN =======================
### Students register themselves here. Teacher, staff and admin accounts are
### created by the admin (see "Create an account" at the end of this file).

### Register a student (name letters + student code)  -> 201
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nguyễn Quỳnh Anh", "email": "anhnq2410099@usth.edu.vn", "password": "Secret123" }

### A teacher email has no student code  -> 400
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Teacher", "email": "huydt@usth.edu.vn", "password": "Secret123" }

### A Gmail address  -> 400
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Someone", "email": "someone@gmail.com", "password": "Secret123" }

### Log in as a student
# @name student
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "antt2410071@usth.edu.vn", "password": "Password@123" }

### Log in as a teacher
# @name teacher
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "huydt@usth.edu.vn", "password": "Password@123" }

### Log in as the admin
# @name admin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@usth.edu.vn", "password": "Password@123" }

### An email outside the university  -> 400
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "someone@gmail.com", "password": "Password@123" }

###
@studentToken = {{student.response.body.token}}
@teacherToken = {{teacher.response.body.token}}
@adminToken = {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Who am I?
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ======================= BROWSE ROOMS =======================

### Room types and who may book them
GET {{api}}/facilities/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### All rooms (can_book = 1 means I am allowed to book it)
GET {{api}}/facilities
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Search and filter by type
GET {{api}}/facilities?search=room&categoryId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Room details (who_can_book = the rule for this room)
GET {{api}}/facilities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Filter by capacity and only open rooms
GET {{api}}/facilities?minCapacity=20&onlyAvailable=true
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### The 28 slots of a day: Free / Waiting for approval / Booked / Closed
### Each slot also has canTakeOver = true when MY role may take it (teacher over student)
GET {{api}}/facilities/1/availability?date={{day}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ======================= BOOKINGS =======================

### 1. Book Study Room A101, slot 10:01-10:30  -> 201
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityId": 1,
  "bookingDate": "{{day}}",
  "startTime": "10:01",
  "endTime": "10:30",
  "purpose": "Group study for the database exam"
}

### 2. The same slot again  -> 409 with the taken time
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facilityId": 1, "bookingDate": "{{day}}", "startTime": "10:01", "endTime": "10:30",
  "purpose": "This request should be refused" }

### 3. The next slot 10:31-11:00  -> 201
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facilityId": 1, "bookingDate": "{{day}}", "startTime": "10:31", "endTime": "11:00",
  "purpose": "Project work for the web course" }

### 4. A time that is not a slot (10:00-12:00)  -> 400
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facilityId": 1, "bookingDate": "{{day}}", "startTime": "10:00", "endTime": "12:00",
  "purpose": "This request should be refused" }

### 5. No purpose  -> 400
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facilityId": 2, "bookingDate": "{{day}}", "startTime": "09:01", "endTime": "09:30", "purpose": "" }

### 6. Student books the Teacher Meeting Room (room type rule)  -> 403
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facilityId": 4, "bookingDate": "{{day}}", "startTime": "09:01", "endTime": "09:30",
  "purpose": "Club meeting for the students" }

### 7. Student books Chemistry Lab D101 (this ROOM is teachers only)  -> 403
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facilityId": 5, "bookingDate": "{{day}}", "startTime": "09:01", "endTime": "09:30",
  "purpose": "Chemistry practice for the exam" }

### 8. Room is unavailable (Badminton Hall)  -> 409
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facilityId": 7, "bookingDate": "{{day}}", "startTime": "09:01", "endTime": "09:30",
  "purpose": "Badminton club practice" }

### 9. Teacher takes slot 10:01-10:30 from the student  -> 201, "replacedBookings": 1
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "facilityId": 1, "bookingDate": "{{day}}", "startTime": "10:01", "endTime": "10:30",
  "purpose": "Tutorial session for class DB01" }

### Numbers and lists for my dashboard
GET {{api}}/bookings/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### My bookings (booking 1 is now CANCELLED with a note)
GET {{api}}/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Only my pending bookings
GET {{api}}/bookings/my?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Cancel my booking (use an id from "My bookings")
PATCH {{api}}/bookings/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Our group changed the day" }

### Change my password
PUT {{api}}/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Password@123", "newPassword": "Password@456" }

### ======================= ADMIN =======================

### Numbers and lists for the admin dashboard
GET {{api}}/admin/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Requests waiting for review
GET {{api}}/admin/bookings?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Booking history of all users
GET {{api}}/admin/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve booking 3
PATCH {{api}}/admin/bookings/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "APPROVED" }

### Reject (a note is required). Booking 3 is already approved, so this returns 409.
PATCH {{api}}/admin/bookings/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "REJECTED", "note": "The room is used for an exam" }

### Add a room that only teachers may book
POST {{api}}/admin/facilities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1, "name": "Study Room A103", "location": "Building A, Floor 1",
  "capacity": 10, "description": "New study room", "equipment": "Whiteboard",
  "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/seed/study-a103/640/400",
  "allowedRoles": ["TEACHER"] }

### Capacity must be 1..300  -> 400
POST {{api}}/admin/facilities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1, "name": "Too big room", "capacity": 400 }

### Capacity cannot be negative  -> 400
POST {{api}}/admin/facilities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1, "name": "Negative room", "capacity": -5 }

### Edit a room ("allowedRoles": [] means: follow the room type again)
PUT {{api}}/admin/facilities/8
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1, "name": "Study Room A103", "location": "Building A, Floor 1",
  "capacity": 12, "description": "Renovated", "equipment": "Whiteboard, TV",
  "imageUrl": "", "allowedRoles": [] }

### Close a room (its future bookings become CANCELLED)
PATCH {{api}}/admin/facilities/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "UNAVAILABLE" }

### Open it again
PATCH {{api}}/admin/facilities/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "AVAILABLE" }

### Delete (hide) a room
DELETE {{api}}/admin/facilities/8
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create an account (any role - students can also register themselves)
POST {{api}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nguyễn Văn Hoàng", "email": "hoangnv2410073@usth.edu.vn",
  "password": "Secret123", "role": "STUDENT" }

### An email outside the university  -> 400
POST {{api}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Outside user", "email": "someone@gmail.com", "password": "Secret123", "role": "STUDENT" }

### Users
GET {{api}}/admin/users?search=2410
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lock a user
PATCH {{api}}/admin/users/5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

### Unlock the user and change the role
PATCH {{api}}/admin/users/5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": true, "role": "STAFF" }
